    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/Cvss4ModifiedUserInteraction#NONE> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/Cvss4ModifiedUserInteraction#PASSIVE> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/Cvss4ModifiedUserInteraction#ACTIVE> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/Cvss4ModifiedUserInteraction#NOT_DEFINED> ) ;
